flowchart TB
  Q["New request + trusted project scope"] --> L["Load instructions and exact task records"]
  L --> R["Optional semantic recall: embed query with Bedrock"]
  R --> S["OpenSearch: authorized project + unexpired memories"]
  S --> V["Verify source revision; select small cited context"]
  V --> W["Reason, use tools and validate"]
  W --> H["Save task evidence in authoritative records"]
  H --> A{"Approved durable learning?"}
  A -->|No| E["Finish without a memory write"]
  A -->|Yes| C["Redact, chunk and attach source + expiry"]
  C --> B["Bedrock embedding"]
  B --> I["Upsert derived OpenSearch memory"]
  I -. "Available to a later request" .-> S
